#exam-pointer(title: "CUET High-Yield Memory Hooks & Diagnostic Triad")[
  1. *Household & Industrial Fermentation Triad:* LAB coagulates milk casein and enriches Vitamin B#sub[12]; _Saccharomyces cerevisiae_ drives bread leavening ($C O_2$) and alcoholic fermentation; wine and beer are un-distilled, whereas whisky, brandy, and rum are distilled; Swiss cheese holes are created by $C O_2$ from _Propionibacterium freudenreichii_ subsp. _shermanii_; Roquefort cheese is ripened by _Penicillium roqueforti_.
  2. *Biochemicals & Biomedical Therapeutics Triad:* Citric acid (_Aspergillus niger_), Acetic acid (_Acetobacter aceti_), Butyric acid (_Clostridium butylicum_), Lactic acid (_Lactobacillus_); Streptokinase from _Streptococcus_ acts as an emergency myocardial "clot buster"; Cyclosporin A from _Trichoderma polysporum_ is an immunosuppressive drug; Statins from _Monascus purpureus_ competitively inhibit HMG-CoA reductase to lower blood cholesterol.
  3. *Ecological Sewage, Biogas & Biofertiliser Triad:* Aerobic aeration flocs (bacteria + fungi) consume organic waste to drastically lower BOD; anaerobic digestion of activated sludge yields Biogas ($C H_4 + C O_2$); _Trichoderma_ protects roots from fungi; Baculoviruses (_Nucleopolyhedrovirus_) offer species-specific, narrow-spectrum insecticidal control with zero non-target toxicity; Mycorrhizae (_Glomus_) absorb phosphorus; Cyanobacteria (_Anabaena_, _Nostoc_) fertilize paddy fields.
]

