= Master Diagnostic Cheatsheet & Fatal CUET Traps

#cheatsheet-box(title: "Master Conceptual & Diagnostic Cheatsheet — Microbes in Human Welfare")[
  - *Lactic Acid Bacteria (LAB):* Ferment lactose to lactic acid, coagulating milk casein into curd; significantly increases *Vitamin B#sub[12]*; checks harmful stomach microbes.
  - *Fermented Food Stuffs:* Dosa/idli batter rises due to $C O_2$ by _Leuconostoc_; bread dough leavened by Baker's yeast (*_Saccharomyces cerevisiae_*); Swiss cheese large holes carved by $C O_2$ from *_Propionibacterium freudenreichii_ subsp. _shermanii_*; Roquefort cheese ripened by the mold *_Penicillium roqueforti_*.
  - *Alcoholic Distillation:* Wine and Beer are *un-distilled* (lower alcohol); Whisky, Brandy, and Rum are concentrated via *distillation* of fermented wash.
  - *Penicillin Discovery:* Sir Alexander Fleming (1928) isolated penicillin from mold _Penicillium notatum_ inhibiting _Staphylococcus_; therapeutic potential proven by Howard Florey and Ernst Chain (treating WWII soldiers); 1945 Nobel Prize to Fleming, Florey, and Chain.
  - *Industrial Chemicals:* Citric acid (*_Aspergillus niger_* - fungus); Acetic acid (*_Acetobacter aceti_* - bacterium); Butyric acid (*_Clostridium butylicum_* - bacterium); Lactic acid (*_Lactobacillus_* - bacterium).
  - *Industrial Enzymes & Bioactive Drugs:* Lipases in laundry detergents; Pectinases & Proteases for clarifying bottled fruit juices; *Streptokinase* (_Streptococcus_) as emergency myocardial "clot buster"; *Cyclosporin A* (_Trichoderma polysporum_) as organ transplant immunosuppressant; *Statins* (_Monascus purpureus_) as blood cholesterol-lowering competitive inhibitors of HMG-CoA reductase.
  - *Sewage Treatment (STP):* Primary treatment removes physical solids via sequential filtration and grit sedimentation; Secondary treatment uses aerobic *flocs* (bacteria + fungi) to drastically reduce *Biochemical Oxygen Demand (BOD)*; high BOD = heavy organic pollution.
  - *Sludge Digestion & Biogas:* Settled flocs form *activated sludge*; digested by anaerobic methanogens (*_Methanobacterium_*) to produce *Biogas* (50–70% $C H_4$, 30–40% $C O_2$, trace $H_2 S$); rural biogas technology developed by IARI and KVIC.
  - *Biocontrol Agents:* Ladybird beetles kill aphids; dragonflies kill mosquitoes; Bt spores kill butterfly caterpillars; _Trichoderma_ suppresses root fungal pathogens; *Baculoviruses (NPV)* provide species-specific, narrow-spectrum insecticidal control with zero non-target toxicity (ideal for IPM).
  - *Biofertilisers:* Nitrogen fixers: symbiotic (*_Rhizobium_*, *_Frankia_* in non-legume _Alnus_), free-living (*_Azotobacter_*, *_Beijerinckia_*, *_Clostridium_*), associative (*_Azospirillum_*); Mycorrhiza (*_Glomus_*) absorbs *phosphorus*; Cyanobacteria (*_Anabaena_*, *_Nostoc_*, *_Oscillatoria_*) fertilize paddy fields.
]

#v(2pt)

#exception-box(title: "The Seven Fatal CUET Traps in Microbes in Human Welfare")[
  1. *The Distilled vs Non-Distilled Trap:* Never confuse beverages! Wine and Beer are produced *without distillation*; Whisky, Brandy, and Rum are produced *with distillation*.
  2. *The Chemical Source Taxonomy Trap:* _Aspergillus niger_ is a *fungus* (producing citric acid); _Acetobacter aceti_ and _Clostridium butylicum_ are *bacteria*; _Monascus purpureus_ is a *yeast/fungus* (producing statins).
  3. *The Swiss Cheese Gas Trap:* The large holes in Swiss cheese are caused by $C O_2$ gas released by the bacterium _Propionibacterium freudenreichii_ subsp. _shermanii_, NOT by yeast or fungi!
  4. *The BOD Pollution Metric Trap:* Remember: *Higher BOD indicates greater organic pollution* and higher polluting potential. Low BOD indicates clean water.
  5. *The Flocs Composition Trap:* Flocs consist of *aerobic bacteria associated with fungal filaments*, NOT anaerobic microbes.
  6. *The Baculovirus Target Trap:* Baculoviruses of the genus _Nucleopolyhedrovirus_ have *zero negative impacts* on plants, mammals, birds, fish, or non-target insects. They are strictly species-specific and narrow-spectrum.
  7. *The Mycorrhizal Mineral Trap:* Mycorrhizal fungi (genus _Glomus_) specifically absorb *phosphorus* from the soil and pass it to host plants, NOT nitrogen!
]

